  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R&O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Risk:\n1. Potential interruptions in operational continuity due to power outage attributable to exclusive reliance on nonrenewable energy sources.\n2. Impact reputation and financial performance.\n\nOpportunity:\n1. Implement energy and cost saving initiatives.\n2. Develop renewable sources of energy consumption alternatives for long term consumption.\n3. Achieve reduction in Green House Gas (GHG) emissions through energy management initiatives'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is '1. Develop robust GHG inventory for Z’s global operations, identify sources of energy consumption and carbon emissions.\n2. Identify areas of deployment of energy conservation and carbon emissions reduction strategies.\n3. Replace outdated equipment and systems with energyefficient technology.\n4. Develop climate change strategy for carbon emissions reduction.\n5. Conduct Climate risk mapping and energy audits.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
