  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'StatementByDirectorResponsibleForTheBusinessResponsibilityReportHighlightingESGRelatedChallengesTargetsAndAchievementsExplanatoryTextBlock' (StatementByDirectorResponsibleForTheBusinessResponsibilityReportHighlightingESGRelatedChallengesTargetsAndAchievementsExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Chief Executive Officer, Key Managerial Personnel of the Company is responsible for the business responsibility report of the\nCompany as authorized by the Board of Directors of the Company.\nThe rapidly evolving Media & Entertainment (M&E) sector is progressively defined by creativity and its ability to engage and\nenlighten the audiences. At ‘Z’ ESG values flow through our operations and in the content we create. Our approach to implement ESG\nin the organizational structure by fostering collaborative engagement with stakeholders, meticulously measuring ESG parameters,\nand articulating our strategies through transparent public reporting. Our ESG strategy and the implementation roadmap are\nformulated based on the material issues identified through a comprehensive exercise of double materiality assessment during FY\n2024-25. A significant progress in E, S and G has been achieved through the strategies adopted throughout the year. We strive to\nachieve business success while connecting with individuals and communities worldwide through our on-screen content and offscreen\nendeavors in the realm of women empowerment, integrated rural development, public health enhancement, preservation\nof our cultural heritage and disaster relief and recovery. We have collaborated with NGOs for community development programs\nas per the CSR policy of the Company.\nAlso refer to our CEO’s message given in the Annual Report FY 2024-25.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: StatementByDirectorResponsibleForTheBusinessResponsibilityReportHighlightingESGRelatedChallengesTargetsAndAchievementsExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfTheHighestAuthorityResponsibleForImplementationAndOversightOfTheBusinessResponsibilityPolicyExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfTheHighestAuthorityResponsibleForImplementationAndOversightOfTheBusinessResponsibilityPolicyExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Mr. Punit Goenka\nDesignation - Chief Executive Officer (CEO)'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfTheHighestAuthorityResponsibleForImplementationAndOversightOfTheBusinessResponsibilityPolicyExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveASpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssues' (DoesTheEntityHaveASpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssues) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityHaveASpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssues, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfSpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssuesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfSpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssuesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Our board committees look at all dimensions of ESG via Audit Committee (AC), CSR Committee, Nomination\nand Renumeration Committee (NRC), Stakeholders Redressal Committee (SRC) and Risk Management Committee (RMC).\nOur board committee scrutinize the aspects of ESG on regular intervals, such as RMC identifies ESG material issues,\nongoing CSR projects/ fundings etc.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfSpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssuesExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
