  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoard' (DoesTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoard) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoard, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock) is '‘Z’ has zero tolerance towards unethical business practices and follows strict guidelines in relation to conflict of interest. ‘Z’ has a\nseparate CoC for Directors and Senior Management which inter alia provides that while performing their duties, Directors shall carry out their\nresponsibilities to the exclusion of any personal advantage, benefit or interest. In case of conflict, Directors shall promptly inform the Board\nand withdraw from participation in decision-making connected with the matter. For more details, please refer to CoC for Directors and Senior\nManagement at link - https://assets-prod.zee.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Code-of-Conduct-for-Board-and-SMP-Clean.pdf'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
