  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WebLinkOfEqualOppertunityPolicyTextBlock' (WebLinkOfEqualOppertunityPolicyTextBlock) is 'https://www.zee.com/'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WebLinkOfEqualOppertunityPolicyTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForTheFollowingCategoriesOfEmployeesAndWorker' (IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForTheFollowingCategoriesOfEmployeesAndWorker) is 'true'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForTheFollowingCategoriesOfEmployeesAndWorker, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForPermanentWorkers' (IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForPermanentWorkers) is 'false'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForPermanentWorkers, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForOtherThanPermanentWorkers' (IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForOtherThanPermanentWorkers) is 'false'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForOtherThanPermanentWorkers, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForPermanentEmployees' (IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForPermanentEmployees) is 'true'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForPermanentEmployees, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForPermanentEmployeesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForPermanentEmployeesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'if any permanent employees have a concern or grievance – they reach out to their either Human\nResource Business Partners (HRBP) or managers. If they reach out to their managers, the managers loop the\nHRBP. The HRBP spends time with the employees to understand the details and access the grievance. The\naction plan is created by the HRBP in consultation with the Head of the Department (HOD) while keeping\nthe Chief Human Resource Officer (CHRO) in the loop and accordingly the redressal of the grievance is\nactioned. The same is closed with the employee within the stipulated timelines'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForPermanentEmployeesExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForOtherThanPermanentEmployees' (IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForOtherThanPermanentEmployees) is 'true'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IsThereAMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForOtherThanPermanentEmployees, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForOtherThanPermanentEmployeesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForOtherThanPermanentEmployeesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'the HR of their parent company of the other than permanent employees along with Z’s HR follows the\nsimilar process as stipulated above for permanent employees, to address and solve the grievances'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfMechanismAvailableToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesForOtherThanPermanentEmployeesExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WhetherAnOccupationalHealthAndSafetyManagementSystemHasBeenImplementedByTheEntity' (WhetherAnOccupationalHealthAndSafetyManagementSystemHasBeenImplementedByTheEntity) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WhetherAnOccupationalHealthAndSafetyManagementSystemHasBeenImplementedByTheEntity, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfOccupationalHealthAndSafetyManagementSystemExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfOccupationalHealthAndSafetyManagementSystemExplanatoryTextBlock) is ''Z' aims to provide a safe and accident free environment to the employees and contractors working in its premises. The\noccupational health and safety management system is based on Z's Employee Health and Safety (EHS) policy. This policy is applicable to\nall the employees and Z's subsidiaries. The processes of periodic assessments to identify safety risk and hazards at workplace, incident\nmanagement and reporting, prevention of incident, investigation of safety incidents, reporting, training and awareness are followed vigorously'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfOccupationalHealthAndSafetyManagementSystemExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DesclosureOfTheProcessesUsedToIdentifyWorkRelatedHazardsAndAssessRisksOnARoutineAndNonRoutineBasisByTheEntityExplanatoryTextBlock' (DesclosureOfTheProcessesUsedToIdentifyWorkRelatedHazardsAndAssessRisksOnARoutineAndNonRoutineBasisByTheEntityExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Identifying work-related hazards and assessing risks on a routine and non-routine basis are essential components of ensuring\na safe and healthy work environment. Based on our EHS Policy, regular workplace inspections are conducted systematically to examine the\nphysical environment, equipment, and processes to identify potential hazards conditions on a routine and non-routine basis.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DesclosureOfTheProcessesUsedToIdentifyWorkRelatedHazardsAndAssessRisksOnARoutineAndNonRoutineBasisByTheEntityExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WhetherYouHaveProcessesForWorkersToReportTheWorkRelatedHazardsAndToRemoveThemselvesFromSuchRisks' (WhetherYouHaveProcessesForWorkersToReportTheWorkRelatedHazardsAndToRemoveThemselvesFromSuchRisks) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WhetherYouHaveProcessesForWorkersToReportTheWorkRelatedHazardsAndToRemoveThemselvesFromSuchRisks, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoTheEmployeesOrWorkerOfTheEntityHaveAccessToNonOccupationalMedicalAndHealthcareServices' (DoTheEmployeesOrWorkerOfTheEntityHaveAccessToNonOccupationalMedicalAndHealthcareServices) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoTheEmployeesOrWorkerOfTheEntityHaveAccessToNonOccupationalMedicalAndHealthcareServices, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheMeasuresTakenByTheEntityToEnsureASafeAndHealthyWorkPlaceExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheMeasuresTakenByTheEntityToEnsureASafeAndHealthyWorkPlaceExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'a. Compliance with all applicable legal requirements pertaining to EHS which is a minimum requirement for the health and safety measures.\nb. Regularly upgrade our safety practices to maintain compliance with updated regulatory requirements.\nc. The EHS policy is available on intranet, as part of our commitment to ensure safety of people and assets at workplace. Also, the same\nis used as part of awareness on safety hazards and risks at workplace for the employees.\nd. EHS policy is timely reviewed and revised, if required as and when any upgrades in health and safety practices at workplace are\nimplemented.\ne. Regular safety inspections and risk assessments to be conducted to identify potential hazards and assess risks to employee health and\nsafety. Implement controls to mitigate identified hazards to prevent accidents or injuries.\nf. Promote and maintain open and constructive dialogue with stakeholders'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DescribeTheMeasuresTakenByTheEntityToEnsureASafeAndHealthyWorkPlaceExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSafetyRelatedIncidentsOfYourPlantsAndOfficesThatWereAssessedExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSafetyRelatedIncidentsOfYourPlantsAndOfficesThatWereAssessedExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'NA'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSafetyRelatedIncidentsOfYourPlantsAndOfficesThatWereAssessedExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfHealthAndSafetyPracticesOfYourPlantsAndOfficesThatWereAssessedP3' (PercentageOfHealthAndSafetyPracticesOfYourPlantsAndOfficesThatWereAssessedP3) is '1' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfHealthAndSafetyPracticesOfYourPlantsAndOfficesThatWereAssessedP3, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfWorkingConditionsOfYourPlantsAndOfficesThatWereAssessedP3' (PercentageOfWorkingConditionsOfYourPlantsAndOfficesThatWereAssessedP3) is '1' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfWorkingConditionsOfYourPlantsAndOfficesThatWereAssessedP3, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
