    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityExtendAnyLifeInsuranceOrAnyCompensatoryPackageInTheEventOfDeathOfEmployees' (DoesTheEntityExtendAnyLifeInsuranceOrAnyCompensatoryPackageInTheEventOfDeathOfEmployees) is 'true'.",
