    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityExtendAnyLifeInsuranceOrAnyCompensatoryPackageInTheEventOfDeathOfWorkers, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfMeasuresUndertakenByTheEntityToEnsureThatStatutoryDuesHaveBeenDeductedAndDepositedByTheValueChainPartnersExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfMeasuresUndertakenByTheEntityToEnsureThatStatutoryDuesHaveBeenDeductedAndDepositedByTheValueChainPartnersExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Third-party consultants are engaged in verification of compliances of all the applicable legal requirements. ESIC and PF\ncompliances for employees are deposited by the value chain partners on state government online portal. The acknowledgement copies of\nsuch submission are generated after completion of the online process. These documents are used for further assurance and validation by the\nappointed third-party consultants.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfMeasuresUndertakenByTheEntityToEnsureThatStatutoryDuesHaveBeenDeductedAndDepositedByTheValueChainPartnersExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityProvideTransitionAssistanceProgramsToFacilitateContinuedEmployabilityAndTheManagementOfCareerEndingsResultingFromRetirementOrTerminationOfEmployment' (DoesTheEntityProvideTransitionAssistanceProgramsToFacilitateContinuedEmployabilityAndTheManagementOfCareerEndingsResultingFromRetirementOrTerminationOfEmployment) is 'No'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityProvideTransitionAssistanceProgramsToFacilitateContinuedEmployabilityAndTheManagementOfCareerEndingsResultingFromRetirementOrTerminationOfEmployment, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfHealthAndSafetyPracticesOfValueChainPartnersP3' (PercentageOfHealthAndSafetyPracticesOfValueChainPartnersP3) is '0.119' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfHealthAndSafetyPracticesOfValueChainPartnersP3, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfWorkingConditionsOfValueChainPartnersP3' (PercentageOfWorkingConditionsOfValueChainPartnersP3) is '0.119' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfWorkingConditionsOfValueChainPartnersP3, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSafetyRelatedIncidentsOnAssessmentOfValueChainPartnersExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSafetyRelatedIncidentsOnAssessmentOfValueChainPartnersExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'No risks or concerns have been observed during the assessments of the value chain partners.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSafetyRelatedIncidentsOnAssessmentOfValueChainPartnersExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheProcessesForIdentifyingKeyStakeholderGroupsOfTheEntityExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheProcessesForIdentifyingKeyStakeholderGroupsOfTheEntityExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Our stakeholders encompass a diverse array of entities, including investors, customers, suppliers, employees, regulators, and the communities.\nInvestors, who provide vital capital, occupy a position of paramount importance within our stakeholder landscape. ‘Z’ is fortunate to have\nbuilt a robust and mutually beneficial relationship with our investors, which is built upon a deep understanding of their expectations and\nour unwavering dedication to meeting them consistently. Our commitment to delivering client value is a fundamental part of our corporate\nphilosophy, underscoring our unwavering devotion to our clients. Employees serve as pivotal assets in creating value for our clients and\nthe organization; thus, ‘Z’ prioritizes the provision of gratifying career pathways for such personnel. Suppliers represent indispensable\nstakeholders, bolstering our enterprise by furnishing essential goods and services. Our unwavering adherence to statutory obligations forms\na cornerstone of our Code of Conduct, accentuating the importance of governmental authorities and regulators in the stakeholder ensemble.\nIn alignment with our pledge to inclusive growth, 'Z' insists upon placing the community at the heart of its sustainable business practices,\nas illustrated through initiatives aimed at empowering women, safeguarding and cherishing our cultural legacy, facilitating disaster relief and\nrecovery, and propelling integrated rural development initiatives'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DescribeTheProcessesForIdentifyingKeyStakeholderGroupsOfTheEntityExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'ProvideTheProcessesForConsultationBetweenStakeholdersAndTheBoardOnEconomicEnvironmentalAndSocialTopicsOrIfConsultationIsDelegatedHowIsFeedbackFromSuchConsultationsProvidedToTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock' (ProvideTheProcessesForConsultationBetweenStakeholdersAndTheBoardOnEconomicEnvironmentalAndSocialTopicsOrIfConsultationIsDelegatedHowIsFeedbackFromSuchConsultationsProvidedToTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Consultation with stakeholders on E, S and G topics are delegated to the Risk and audit team within the organization, as part of\noverall risk management framework. This Risk and internal audit team is engaging with stakeholders continuously and communicates to the\nboard on the development of the stakeholder engagement. ‘Z’ has a presence across multiple geographies and the universe of our material\nconcerns is complex and multi-layered. The Risk and audit team identifies such material concerns and their risks and opportunities to the\nbusiness. This is presented to the Risk and audit committee for their reviews and preparing business strategies. The material concerns are\ndeeply intertwined with the decisions ‘Z’ implements and the value it seeks to create through the business. Within the domains of E, S and\nG, ‘Z’ constantly reviews the most important issues and prepares for them through consultations. ‘Z’ has identified significant material issues\nthrough data-driven and consultative exercise. Material topics were shortlisted and prioritized based on their impact on our stakeholders and\nour business. On a quarterly basis, every key department shares feedback with the Board on the Material issues.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: ProvideTheProcessesForConsultationBetweenStakeholdersAndTheBoardOnEconomicEnvironmentalAndSocialTopicsOrIfConsultationIsDelegatedHowIsFeedbackFromSuchConsultationsProvidedToTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WhetherStakeholderConsultationIsUsedToSupportTheIdentificationAndManagementOfEnvironmentalAndSocialTopics' (WhetherStakeholderConsultationIsUsedToSupportTheIdentificationAndManagementOfEnvironmentalAndSocialTopics) is 'true'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WhetherStakeholderConsultationIsUsedToSupportTheIdentificationAndManagementOfEnvironmentalAndSocialTopics, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfInstancesAsToHowTheInputsReceivedFromStakeholdersOnTheseTopicsWereIncorporatedIntoPoliciesAndActivitiesOfTheEntityExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfInstancesAsToHowTheInputsReceivedFromStakeholdersOnTheseTopicsWereIncorporatedIntoPoliciesAndActivitiesOfTheEntityExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Z' has framed its ESG Vision/Strategy on material topics in detailed consultation with its stakeholders. Material topics were\nfurther shortlisted and prioritized based on their impact on our stakeholders and business. Our ESG priorities, as part of the Company’s ESG\nVision/Strategy can be accessed at the link - https://www.zee.com/responsibilities-landing/.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfInstancesAsToHowTheInputsReceivedFromStakeholdersOnTheseTopicsWereIncorporatedIntoPoliciesAndActivitiesOfTheEntityExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfInstancesOfEngagementWithAndActionsTakenToAddressTheConcernsOfVulnerableMarginalizedStakeholderGroupsExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfInstancesOfEngagementWithAndActionsTakenToAddressTheConcernsOfVulnerableMarginalizedStakeholderGroupsExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'NA'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfInstancesOfEngagementWithAndActionsTakenToAddressTheConcernsOfVulnerableMarginalizedStakeholderGroupsExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
