  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WeblinkWhereInformationOnProductsAndServicesOfTheEntityCanBeAccessedExplanatoryTextBlock' (WeblinkWhereInformationOnProductsAndServicesOfTheEntityCanBeAccessedExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Details of our product and services can be checked at our website https://www.zee.com/products-platforms-landing/.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WeblinkWhereInformationOnProductsAndServicesOfTheEntityCanBeAccessedExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'StepsTakenToInformAndEducateConsumersAboutSafeAndResponsibleUsageOfProductsAndOrServicesExplanatoryTextBlock' (StepsTakenToInformAndEducateConsumersAboutSafeAndResponsibleUsageOfProductsAndOrServicesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Z' operates in media and entertainment industry and its product or services include general entertainment content which reaches\nits viewers through linear channels or its streaming service ZEE5. While safe and responsible usage does not apply in Z’s business context, it\nhas adequate messaging built in its content and services to inform and educate its viewers about the content they consume, as applicable.\nSome of these examples include:\n- A detailed terms of usage for ZEE5 viewers is available at https://www.zee5.com/termsofuse\n- In the case of movies, a certificate issued by Central Board of Film Certification (CBFC) which indicates the category of audiences\nallowed to watch movie as per their age is shown at the beginning of the movie. These categories are “U” (unrestricted public exhibition),\n“A” (restricted to adult audiences), “UA” (unrestricted public exhibition subject to parental guidance for children below the age of\ntwelve) and “S” (restricted to specialized audiences such as doctors or scientists).\n- And for the linear content on TV channels appropriate disclaimer notice is displayed for the source of contents if it is based on historical\nevents, true events, fiction, etc. The disclaimers are displayed in local language on regional TV channels for better understanding of the\nviewers about the content of the show.\n- Health warnings such as Anti-tobacco are displayed during the streaming of movies or TV shows as embedded message of the content.\n- SnP validation happens on contents to ensure content is appropriate.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: StepsTakenToInformAndEducateConsumersAboutSafeAndResponsibleUsageOfProductsAndOrServicesExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MechanismsInPlaceToInformConsumersOfAnyRiskOfDisruptionOrDiscontinuationOfEssentialServicesExplanatoryTextBlock' (MechanismsInPlaceToInformConsumersOfAnyRiskOfDisruptionOrDiscontinuationOfEssentialServicesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Z' is not involved in directly providing essential services.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MechanismsInPlaceToInformConsumersOfAnyRiskOfDisruptionOrDiscontinuationOfEssentialServicesExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityDisplayProductInformationOnTheProductOverAndAboveWhatIsMandatedAsPerLocalLaws' (DoesTheEntityDisplayProductInformationOnTheProductOverAndAboveWhatIsMandatedAsPerLocalLaws) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityDisplayProductInformationOnTheProductOverAndAboveWhatIsMandatedAsPerLocalLaws, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfProductInformationOnTheProductOverAndAboveWhatIsMandatedAsPerLocalLawsExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfProductInformationOnTheProductOverAndAboveWhatIsMandatedAsPerLocalLawsExplanatoryTextBlock) is ''Z' strictly follows guidelines of Ministry of Information and Broadcasting (MIB) for the content it produces or broadcasts,\nbefore it’s viewed by end users. The disclaimers for shows and certificates issued by CBFC for movies are displayed before streaming the\ncontent.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfProductInformationOnTheProductOverAndAboveWhatIsMandatedAsPerLocalLawsExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  }
